{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02614","headline":"田家三首 一 · 王绩","name":"田家三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阮籍生涯懒，嵇康意气疎。\n相逢一醉饱，独坐数行书。\n小池聊养鹤，闲田且牧猪。\n草生元亮径，花暗子云居。\n倚牀看妇织，登壠课儿锄。\n回头寻仙事，并是一空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}